{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14105481","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14105481","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410548101:1":{"text":"この瞬間もイルージアが芽吹こうとしている……地上の太陽があんなに暖かいなんて……","source_cn":"我的幻影花，在慢慢长大呢……谁能想到地表的阳光是如此温暖……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87B32B45D5978F82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410548102:1":{"text":"信じたくないけど、僕たちは本当に騙されてたんだね。上の世界は、陛下が言ってたのと全然違う。","source_cn":"虽然很不想相信，但他们好像真的说了谎。地表根本不是女王...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0EA361652045D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410548103:1":{"text":"でも霊水と竜の話はエイン様に聞かないと……だって、陛下がそんな残酷なことをするはずがないよ……","source_cn":"但恩典灵露和龙……我还是得问问才能死心。女王不会那么残...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F31C61B378F860B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410548104:1":{"text":"ま、お互い地下に戻る理由があるってわけだ。","source_cn":"看来咱们都有必须返回地底的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA967AF9023406CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410548104":{"text":"ま、お互い地下に戻る理由があるってわけだ。","source_cn":"看来咱们都有必须返回地底的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA967AF9023406CEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_t